{"authored" [] "sources" [{"question" "q-316567" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "What is the area scale factor of the linear transformation $T$ that is given by its standard matrix \n\n$$\nT=[\\begin{aligned}6 & 5 \\\\ 4 & 3\\end{aligned}]?\n$$\n\nThe area scale factor is\n{{field-1}} ." "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13992537/state.json" "file_sha256" "b6c8cd7f29652ab1b72a7678983e9fabd844459040fd190b544a5d8e176daeed"} {"question" "q-316567" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The area scale factor of a linear transformation $T$ with standard matrix $T$ is equal to $|det(T)|.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|det(T)| & =|6\\cdot 3-5\\cdot 4| \\\\  & =|18-20| \\\\  & =|-2| \\\\  & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13992537/state.json" "file_sha256" "b6c8cd7f29652ab1b72a7678983e9fabd844459040fd190b544a5d8e176daeed"} {"question" "q-316567" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13992537/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "2a8c1d86158d0bce6141f5941bd280e4068ea6f9a97c0ea498503a64bc1f8988"} {"question" "q-316567" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13992537/state.json" "file_sha256" "b6c8cd7f29652ab1b72a7678983e9fabd844459040fd190b544a5d8e176daeed"} {"question" "q-316567" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "2"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13992537/state.json" "file_sha256" "b6c8cd7f29652ab1b72a7678983e9fabd844459040fd190b544a5d8e